#: templates/about.html:29
#, python-format
msgid ""
"All data in the pages about authors, works, countries and terms come from"
" Wikidata and are under the terms of the %(CC0_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Tolos datos nes páxines sobro autores, obres, países y plazos vienen de "
"Wikidata y tán so los términos de %(CC0_link)s."

#: templates/about.html:30
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The texts and other original content of this website are under a "
"%(ccbysa_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Los testos y demás conteníu orixinal d'esta páxina web tán so una "
"%(ccbysa_link)s."

#: templates/about.html:31
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The images and media in the pages about authors, works, countries and "
"terms come from %(wm_commons_link)s and are under different free licenses"
" or in the public domain. We recommend consulting the information of each"
" content on Wikimedia Commons."
msgstr ""
"Les imáxenes y medios nes páxines sobre autores, obres, países y plazos "
"vienen de %(wm_commons_link)s y tán so distintes llicencies llibres o nel"
" dominiu públicu. Recomendamos consultar la información de cada conteníu "
"en Wikimedia Commons."

#: templates/about.html:32
msgid ""
"The works accessible through links to external sites are available to the"
" public, mostly because they are in the public domain, or under free "
"licenses, but some of them may be under copyright in some jurisdictions. "
"We recommend consulting the information of each work on the websites "
"where they are hosted."
msgstr ""
"Les obres accesibles al traviés d'enllaces a sitios esternos tán "
"disponibles al públicu, mayormente porque tán nel dominiu públicu o so "
"llicencies llibres, pero dalgunes d'elles podrían tar so copyright en "
"dalgunes xurisdiciones. Recomendamos consultar la información de caúna "
"les obres nos sitios webs onde tán albergáes."

